@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Agreed amendment - proposed, NOT implemented
start
:One action changes\nseveral properties;
:Validate the complete event\n(as ONE atomic event);
if (Every value valid?) then (yes)
  :Apply all values when the event\nis processed (even during operation);
  :Keep program and run identity;\nadvance settings revision /\neffective event position;
  note right
    No source rewrite, recompile,
    firmware/bytecode update,
    or controller stop/restart
  end note
else (any invalid)
  :Reject the whole event;\nno mutation;
endif
stop
@enduml
